  "description": "Teriaq is a rich and addictive fragrance that blends golden honey sweetness with warm amber and smooth tobacco depth. The scent is bold, luxurious, and slightly smoky, delivering a deep gourmand character with an elegant Middle Eastern signature. The opening introduces sweet honey and caramelized notes, creating a warm, syrupy, and inviting first impression. The heart develops into tobacco and soft spicy accords, adding depth, richness, and a slightly smoky sophistication. The base settles into amber, vanilla, and woody notes, leaving a long-lasting, warm, and resinous trail. Teriaq is perfect for those who enjoy sweet tobacco fragrances with honeyed warmth and a deep amber finish.",
